From b655952f314df5f3c9516f7f9b36fda16b6d294f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 04:32:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 141/147] hydra: the last French comments and docstrings in
 English

The Python resources (device menu, material builder, colour space menu,
pythonrc), the Render menu XML and four comment blocks in Cycles' own files
(displacement, device memory fallback, noise enum, undisplaced positions).
No code change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
